SUMMARY:2026 Legacy Artist: Jaribu Shahid Salute to the AACM
LOCATION:Hart Plaza - Waterfront Stage
DESCRIPTION:Detroit Jazz Fest 2026. Bassist Jaribu Shahid\, a longtime member of Detroit's jazz avant-garde and of the Association for the Advancement of Creative Musicians (AACM)\, is honored this year as the festival's Legacy Artist with a set celebrating the AACM's boundary-pushing legacy.
